1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,472
Bonjour ! Un billet pour Lyon, s'il vous plaît.
Hello! One ticket to Lyon, please.

2
00:00:05,972 --> 00:00:08,684
Aller simple ou aller-retour ?
One-way or round-trip?

3
00:00:09,184 --> 00:00:12,136
Aller-retour, s'il vous plaît.
Round-trip, please.

4
00:00:12,636 --> 00:00:14,748
Pour aujourd'hui ?
For today?

5
00:00:15,248 --> 00:00:18,896
Oui. À quelle heure part le train ?
Yes. What time does the train leave?

6
00:00:19,396 --> 00:00:21,964
Il part à quatorze heures.
It leaves at two p.m.

7
00:00:22,464 --> 00:00:24,360
De quel quai ?
From which platform?

8
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,212
Du quai numéro trois.
From platform number three.

9
00:00:27,712 --> 00:00:31,576
Merci ! Je dois me dépêcher !
Thanks! I have to hurry!

10
00:00:32,076 --> 00:00:34,116
Bon voyage !
Have a good trip!

